    AI["📊 Azure App Insights\n+ OpenTelemetry"]

    OUT1["🖥️ War Room\n← SSE events"]:::out
    OUT2["🤖 Discord Bot\n← formatted embed"]:::out

    U1 & U2 -->|POST /debates| GRD1
    GRD1 --> EP --> ORCH --> AGENTS
    AGENTS -->|persona-scoped query| AIS
    AIS --> GRD2 -->|sanitized chunks| AGENTS
